/**
 * @page hp_type204_guide HP OEM Type 204: Rack and Enclosure Information Guide
 *
 * @brief Access HP OEM rack, enclosure, and bay information.
 *
 * @note Experimental: this HP OEM type has not been tested with real hardware
 * dumps.
 *
 * @section hp_type204_selection Array result and ownership
 *
 * @ref lazybiosGetOemHpType204 returns every HP OEM Type 204 structure and
 * writes the number of parsed structures to `hptype204_count`. Iterate the
 * returned @ref lazybiosOemHpType204_t array using that count, and pass the
 * same count to @ref lazybiosFreeOemHpType204. When assigned to
 * `ctx->HpType204`, @ref lazybiosCleanup releases the array using
 * `ctx->hptype204_count`.
 *
 * @section hp_type204_fields Fields
 *
 * Type 204 exposes the following optional fields:
 * - `rack_name`
 * - `enclosure_name`, `enclosure_model`, and `enclosure_serial`
 * - `enclosure_bays`
 * - `server_bay`
 * - `bays_filled`
 *
 * Check the corresponding `field_status` member before using each field.
 *
 * @see @ref api_hp_type204
 */

/**
 * @var lazybiosOemHpType204_t* lazybiosCTX::HpType204
 * @brief HP OEM Type 204 structures.
 * @warning Experimental and untested.
 */

/**
 * @var size_t lazybiosCTX::hptype204_count
 * @brief Number of elements in HpType204.
 */
